{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15219220","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15219220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1521922001:1":{"text":"豊穣神が降臨した日、トータス町の誰もがそのことを光栄に思い、競うようにして光を捧げました。","source_cn":"丰饶神降临那天，每个图塔镇的人都为神降感到荣幸，争着要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB074DB7E233A0138","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521922002:1":{"text":"それが次第に……人々は神の奇妙な振る舞いに気付き始めたんです……","source_cn":"但渐渐，大家发现了他的古怪之处……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7A87FC6AE0BC52E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1521922003:0":{"text":"ナルシーは、過去の記憶を語り始めた……","source_cn":"南茜讲述起她的回忆……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B43DC371A580DB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521922004:1":{"text":"ねえ、なんか変じゃない？あれほど陽光を愛されていた豊穣神様なのに、最近は……","source_cn":"你们觉不觉得有点不对劲？丰饶神明明那么热爱阳光，为什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9024E9D54BE33C3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521922005:1":{"text":"シーッ！ナルシー、声が大きい。心の中で思っていればいいことで、わざわざ口に出さないの。","source_cn":"嘘！小点声，南茜。你心里知道是怎么回事就好了，不要说出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x901FA8BAD9665B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521922006:1":{"text":"でも……本当に言うとおり祭祀を執り行うべきなの？","source_cn":"可是……难道我们真的要按他说的，举办祭祀吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7934999B8F4B6A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521922007:1":{"text":"大丈夫、司祭様たちがもう対策を考えてくれてるから。","source_cn":"别担心，祭司们已经想到了办法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAED03CE0AC8877E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521922008:1":{"text":"彼らは……今回の祭祀を利用して、神を追い出すつもりでいる。","source_cn":"……他们打算利用这次的祭祀仪式，将他彻底赶出镇子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4466280E1FFFA5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521922009:1":{"text":"えっ……！？そ……そんなの危険すぎるよ！","source_cn":"什么……？！这……这也太危险了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F8BE5B13F3F14F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521922010:1":{"text":"どれほど危険でも、僕たちの故郷はみんなで守らないと。","source_cn":"不管多危险，我们都得守卫家园。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD3A2B26DF0BB4A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521922011:1":{"text":"司祭様たちの計画では、儀式の前に子どもたちを避難させるようだ。気付かれないよう三つのグループに分けて、順番に出発させるらしい。","source_cn":"祭司们打算在仪式开始前把镇上的孩子都送走。为了避免被发...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86E217CA16C6CB03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521922012:1":{"text":"君とマルコスは第一グループに入れてもらった……だから、急いで荷物をまとめるんだ。","source_cn":"我替你和马可争取到了第一批……所以你们要尽快收拾行李了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BAB0DD3A03EE280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521922013:1":{"text":"でもあなたは……？あなたがいなきゃ、私たちはダメなんだよ！","source_cn":"可是你怎么办？我们不能没有你啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FDF56EC91EAEEC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521922014:1":{"text":"心配ない、僕を信じて。儀式は必ず成功する。","source_cn":"别紧张，相信我，仪式一定会成功的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA4D55E95A6EEDB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521922015:1":{"text":"神が去ったら、すぐに迎えに行く。その頃にはもう、何に怯えることもなくなってるからね。","source_cn":"等他离开了，我就去接你们回来。到时候我们就不用担惊受怕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A2EB9D67F62F196","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521922016:1":{"text":"見てのとおり……計画は失敗に終わりました。","source_cn":"你们看……计划还是失败了。"